{"3770700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Run", "steam_appid": 3770700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Cosmic Run joins Steam Bullet Fest 2026 with FULL RELEASE 💥</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re excited to announce that the full version of Cosmic Run is taking part in Steam Bullet Fest 2026! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the ultimate bullet heaven experience.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there a perfect system in the galaxy? The Zogark family is determined to find out. <br> <br>Cosmic Run is a fast-paced space roguelite about a dysfunctional family searching the galaxy for the “perfect” society. Fight through relentless space police, criminal gangs, and powerful rulers as you upgrade your ship and survive fast-paced roguelite combat across a galaxy full of broken ideologies, bad decisions, and desperate hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>145+ WEAPON &amp; PASSIVE UPGRADES</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHORT &amp; INTENSE SESSIONS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 PERMANENT UPGRADES</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE PLANETS </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAOTIC SPACE COMBAT</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE ENEMIES &amp; BOSSES</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MORE...</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your ship differently in every run</i>. Choose from a wide variety of 12 Unique Weapons and 12 Unique Modules to suit your playstyle and adapt to ever-changing threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.poster.avif?t=1780508853\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.webm?t=1780508853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.mp4?t=1780508853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISTINCT PLAYABLE CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from multiple members of the Zogark family, <i>each with unique strengths, weaknesses, and special abilities.</i> Find the character that best fits your strategy—or master them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTEGRATED DIALOGUE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay immersed in the action with a non-intrusive, real-time dialogue system. Characters speak dynamically during gameplay—offering insights, tips, and story moments without breaking the flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROCEDURALLY GENERATED UPGRADES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No two runs are the same.</i> Encounter randomized upgrade options throughout your journey, forcing you to adapt your tactics and experiment with powerful new builds each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.poster.avif?t=1780508853\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.webm?t=1780508853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/f844ae7e0b05d891f2680130f4136893.mp4?t=1780508853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERSISTENT PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn credits during your missions to <i>unlock and upgrade permanent perks.</i> Even when a run ends, your hard-earned progress carries over—making you stronger with every attempt. <br> <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there a perfect system in the galaxy? The Zogark family is determined to find out. <br> <br>Cosmic Run is a fast-paced space roguelite about a dysfunctional family searching the galaxy for the “perfect” society. Fight through relentless space police, criminal gangs, and powerful rulers as you upgrade your ship and survive fast-paced roguelite combat across a galaxy full of broken ideologies, bad decisions, and desperate hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>145+ WEAPON &amp; PASSIVE UPGRADES</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHORT &amp; INTENSE SESSIONS</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 PERMANENT UPGRADES</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MULTIPLE PLANETS </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHAOTIC SPACE COMBAT</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE ENEMIES &amp; BOSSES</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND MORE...</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC SHIP CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your ship differently in every run</i>. Choose from a wide variety of 12 Unique Weapons and 12 Unique Modules to suit your playstyle and adapt to ever-changing threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770700/extras/5a264997f0cf2103c23a2700e1de8b5e.poster.avif?t=1780508853\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://sh